{"3403100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeon Shifters", "steam_appid": 3403100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/extras/bfc20b0f5fa53ec348a7c5e7b826da63.poster.avif?t=1784822579\" width=598 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/extras/bfc20b0f5fa53ec348a7c5e7b826da63.webm?t=1784822579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/extras/bfc20b0f5fa53ec348a7c5e7b826da63.mp4?t=1784822579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the depths...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge your path through a world shattered by a magical comet.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dungeon Shifters</i> is a third-person action RPG set in Year 0 of a catastrophe that changed the world forever. Descend into dangerous dungeons, uncover the origin of a mysterious comet, and face the horrors that awakened beneath the surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Secret-filled dungeons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through vast dungeons connected by branching paths, hidden passages, secret chambers, and ancient relics. Discover murals, journals, and traces of forgotten stories as you piece together a world that will change over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/extras/74bbae5bfadf554e5ce620f4c3aac135.poster.avif?t=1784822579\" width=598 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/extras/74bbae5bfadf554e5ce620f4c3aac135.webm?t=1784822579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/extras/74bbae5bfadf554e5ce620f4c3aac135.mp4?t=1784822579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Third-person combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter challenges your ability to read your enemies. Manage your stamina, control your spacing, dodge at the right moment, and strike when the opportunity arises. Patience and mastery of combat are just as important as the equipment you carry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/extras/3c89fb2842edcbadf60ff5b374fec059.poster.avif?t=1784822579\" width=598 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/extras/3c89fb2842edcbadf60ff5b374fec059.webm?t=1784822579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/extras/3c89fb2842edcbadf60ff5b374fec059.mp4?t=1784822579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face unique enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy features distinct behaviors and attack patterns that demand a different approach. Some will block your attacks, others will punish poor positioning or exploit your mistakes. Learn their movements, uncover their weaknesses, and prepare to face bosses that will push your skills to the limit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A world told through environmental storytelling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of <i>Dungeon Shifters</i> unfolds through exploration. Ancient inscriptions and locations marked by those who never survived hide the answers behind the comet's origin and the fate of those who tried to endure its arrival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you ready to descend?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision, every battle, and every secret you uncover brings you one step closer to the truth. Explore the unknown, master the combat, and discover what lies hidden in the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/extras/85c7d5dd739026aae06743e9867cd3e5.avif?t=1784822579\" width=800 height=458 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/extras/bfc20b0f5fa53ec348a7c5e7b826da63.poster.avif?t=1784822579\" width=598 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/extras/bfc20b0f5fa53ec348a7c5e7b826da63.webm?t=1784822579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/extras/bfc20b0f5fa53ec348a7c5e7b826da63.mp4?t=1784822579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the depths...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge your path through a world shattered by a magical comet.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dungeon Shifters</i> is a third-person action RPG set in Year 0 of a catastrophe that changed the world forever. Descend into dangerous dungeons, uncover the origin of a mysterious comet, and face the horrors that awakened beneath the surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Secret-filled dungeons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through vast dungeons connected by branching paths, hidden passages, secret chambers, and ancient relics. Discover murals, journals, and traces of forgotten stories as you piece together a world that will change over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/extras/74bbae5bfadf554e5ce620f4c3aac135.poster.avif?t=1784822579\" width=598 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/extras/74bbae5bfadf554e5ce620f4c3aac135.webm?t=1784822579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/extras/74bbae5bfadf554e5ce620f4c3aac135.mp4?t=1784822579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Third-person combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter challenges your ability to read your enemies. Manage your stamina, control your spacing, dodge at the right moment, and strike when the opportunity arises. Patience and mastery of combat are just as important as the equipment you carry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/extras/3c89fb2842edcbadf60ff5b374fec059.poster.avif?t=1784822579\" width=598 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/extras/3c89fb2842edcbadf60ff5b374fec059.webm?t=1784822579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/extras/3c89fb2842edcbadf60ff5b374fec059.mp4?t=1784822579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face unique enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy features distinct behaviors and attack patterns that demand a different approach. Some will block your attacks, others will punish poor positioning or exploit your mistakes. Learn their movements, uncover their weaknesses, and prepare to face bosses that will push your skills to the limit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A world told through environmental storytelling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of <i>Dungeon Shifters</i> unfolds through exploration. Ancient inscriptions and locations marked by those who never survived hide the answers behind the comet's origin and the fate of those who tried to endure its arrival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you ready to descend?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision, every battle, and every secret you uncover brings you one step closer to the truth. Explore the unknown, master the combat, and discover what lies hidden in the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/extras/85c7d5dd739026aae06743e9867cd3e5.avif?t=1784822579\" width=800 height=458 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Dungeon Shifters is an action RPG set in a world broken by a magic comet. Explore ancient dungeons, uncover lost secrets, and battle deadly ememies in third-person combat. Choose your adventurer and shape your fate in the depths.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/9f3b9c821aef621adf28b02b102f864c0cc46341/header.jpg?t=1784822579", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/92ea03a931434f62febc3cfd430cb60510380106/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784822579", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403100/92ea03a931434f62febc3cfd430cb60510380106/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784822579", "website": "https://www.gamedeschile.com/index.php/2023/01/17/1746/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit proces